// 289's furnaces (skill_smithing/configs/smelting/smelting.loc) on 2011's:
// 289's furnace1 and furnace2 (2781, 2785) are no furnaces in 2011, which
// smelts at the locs below (cache 786: named Furnace with a Smelt op, placed
// in the map outside Daemonheim; 11010, 12809, 30510 and 36956 are placed
// nowhere in the decoded map, and viking_furnace is quest_viking's). The
// tutorial, Legends' Quest and Underground Pass furnaces keep 289's ids.
// 289's forceapproach is the client's, so it is left to the cache.

[newbiefurnace]
desc=A hot place for forging things in.
category=smithing_furnace

